# Study Time Website

Static bilingual (EN/AR) marketing site for Study Time, a study house / coffee house in Al-Yasmeen, Amman.

## Stack

- Vite + Tailwind CSS 4 + daisyUI 5 (`index.html`, `styles.css`, `script.js`)
- Custom theme `studytime` (brand colors)
- Real place media lives in `media/` (videos, stills, `logo.jpg`)
- Dev: `npm run dev` · Build: `npm run build` · Preview: `npm run preview`

## Content rules

- Prefer real photos/videos from the venue; do not use stock Unsplash imagery
- Keep EN/AR copy in sync via `data-en` / `data-ar` on the same elements
- Tone: welcoming but professional
