## Design

- Follow `.cursor/skills/ui-design-brain` + `.cursor/skills/daisyui`
- Use daisyUI components (`navbar`, `drawer`, `hero`, `btn`, `card`, `badge`, `list`, `menu`, `footer`, `link`)
- Brand first; full-bleed hero video with logo as hero-level signal
- Responsive: mobile-first (`px-4`, stacked CTAs, drawer nav < `lg`, `card-side` from `md`)
- Typography utilities: `display-xl`, `display-lg`, `body-lg` (readable on small screens)
- Support RTL when `dir="rtl"`
- No stock imagery; no ticker/floating promo overlays

## i18n

- Language toggle updates `lang`, `dir`, `document.title`, and all `[data-en][data-ar]` nodes
- Persist choice in `localStorage` key `studytime-language`
